  data: {
    LLM: "Player to dealer's left starts, clockwise. Must play one card from hand face up. If played card matches rank of any face-up center card, capture the played card and all matched cards, adding to your face-up bundle pile with played card on top. If played card matches top card of opponent's bundle, steal their entire bundle and add to yours with your played card on top. After all players play their 4 cards, dealer deals 4 more cards each (no more to layout). Continue until all cards played. Player who made last capture takes any remaining layout cards.",
    Player: "Player to dealer's left starts, clockwise. Must play one card from hand face up. If played card matches rank of any face-up center card, capture the played card and all matched cards, adding to your face-up bundle pile with played card on top. If played card matches top card of opponent's bundle, steal their entire bundle and add to yours with your played card on top. After all players play their 4 cards, dealer deals 4 more cards each (no more to layout). Continue until all cards played. Player who made last capture takes any remaining layout cards.",
    objective: "Collect the most cards by capturing from the layout and stealing opponents' bundles.",
    gameplay: "Player to dealer's left starts, clockwise. Must play one card from hand face up. If played card matches rank of any face-up center card, capture the played card and all matched cards, adding to your face-up bundle pile with played card on top. If played card matches top card of opponent's bundle, steal their entire bundle and add to yours with your played card on top. After all players play their 4 cards, dealer deals 4 more cards each (no more to layout). Continue until all cards played. Player who made last capture takes any remaining layout cards.",
    keyRules: [
      '2-4 players',
      'Only card ranks matter, suits ignored',
      '4 cards dealt to each player, 4 to layout',
      'Must play one card per turn',
      'Match center cards to capture',
      "Match opponent's top bundle card to steal entire bundle",
      'Played card always goes on top of your pile',
      'Multiple deals until deck exhausted',
      'Last capture takes remaining layout',
    ],
